# "A guessing game" — the first project: INPUT, IF, and a loop that keeps
# going until the player is right.
#
# The machine picks with RND, which starts from the same place every time an
# ACE is switched on — so from a freshly booted machine the number is 52, and
# this binary search finds it in five.
wait (OK|\?)
send 50\r
send 75\r
send 62\r
send 56\r
send 52\r
expect ^TOO LOW$
expect ^TOO HIGH$
expect ^GOT IT IN 5 GUESSES$
